flowchart TD
A[Record created or updated] --> B{Object}
B -->|Lead| C{Country / region present?}
C -->|No| D[Route to Data Quality Queue]
C -->|Yes| E{Lead source = Partner?}
E -->|Yes| F[Assign Partner Sales Queue]
E -->|No| G{Employee count >= 250?}
G -->|Yes| H[Assign Enterprise Sales Queue]
G -->|No| I[Assign SMB Sales Queue]
B -->|Case| J{Severity}
J -->|Critical| K[Assign Priority Support Queue]
J -->|High| L[Assign Tier 2 Queue]
J -->|Normal / Low| M[Assign Tier 1 Queue]
D --> N[Log routing reason]
F --> N
H --> N
I --> N
K --> O[Notify duty manager]
L --> N
M --> N
O --> N
N --> P{Assignment succeeded?}
P -->|Yes| Q[End]
P -->|No| R[Fault path: Operations Review Queue]
R --> S[Capture error + notify admin]
S --> Q
